THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS (not distributed in this repository)

The Apptainer image built from menatree.def downloads and includes:
  - EasyCGTree v4.2 (Zhang D-F et al., 2023; https://github.com/zdf1987/EasyCGTree4), with its
    bundled Prodigal, HMMER 3.0, MUSCLE 5, trimAl, FastTree 2 and ASTRAL binaries. At the time of
    writing, the EasyCGTree4 repository does not declare a license; obtain the author's permission
    before redistributing a built image.
  - IQ-TREE 2.3.6 (GPL-2.0), https://github.com/iqtree/iqtree2

Marker models in models/ are derived from:
  - HAMAP (CC BY 4.0): MF_01935, MF_00470, MF_00995, MF_00993, MF_00991, MF_00992, MF_00996
  - NCBIFAM / TIGRFAMs: TIGR00173, TIGR00751, NF005877, NF005637
  - Pfam: PF01209
Their model parameters are unchanged; only header lines (format tag, NAME, ACC, DESC, cut-off,
BM and SM lines) were edited. See models/README.md.
